# Git metadata and editor files are not build inputs.
**/.git
**/.github
**/.gitignore
**/.gitattributes
**/.gitmodules
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/.DS_Store
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/*~

# Dependencies and output are generated inside the build stage.
**/node_modules
**/_site

# Keep local secrets, npm logs, caches, and temporary files out of the image.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/npm-debug.log*
**/npm-*.log
**/.npm
**/.cache
**/.sass-cache
**/.eleventy-cache
**/tmp
**/temp
**/*.tmp

# Package locks, source, Eleventy helpers, and tests remain in the context.
